{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wouldn't everyone want to have a giant laser battle cat to overcome life's challenges with a devastating beam?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/extras/15d7c6bf03d556aebad397ce3a38fd5f.poster.avif?t=1771016281\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/extras/15d7c6bf03d556aebad397ce3a38fd5f.webm?t=1771016281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/extras/15d7c6bf03d556aebad397ce3a38fd5f.mp4?t=1771016281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Kittens!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 5 kittens, each with different stats and appearances. Unlock them by completing levels and give them names. Feed them radioactive milk to make them bigger and stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/extras/f5e7dec54900d4b0235bab4f0c195ff2.poster.avif?t=1771016281\" width=600 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/extras/f5e7dec54900d4b0235bab4f0c195ff2.webm?t=1771016281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/extras/f5e7dec54900d4b0235bab4f0c195ff2.mp4?t=1771016281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer Five Continents!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cat is equipped with a vest\u2014build a laser mechanism on it. Generate power, store it in batteries, and fire away. Use rotating and sliding parts to reach all enemies. Defeat European pigeons, African snakes, and Australian spiders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/extras/8b543337ed39c8f9e93af13bd38bc740.poster.avif?t=1771016281\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/extras/8b543337ed39c8f9e93af13bd38bc740.webm?t=1771016281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/extras/8b543337ed39c8f9e93af13bd38bc740.mp4?t=1771016281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take Care of Your Home!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add extra furniture, buy pots, plant valerian and catnip. Water the plants, then prepare potions for your cat. Purchase additional workshop equipment to unlock more components for the laser mechanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel and destroy!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cat of All Cats","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3098920/0be0c12b62fba4f015be623c7d09b047fe454dfd.jpg"},{"name":"Handyman Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3098920/9c7d5b235d2b17b37a457f4909ed479d89dd18da.jpg"},{"name":"Chemist Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3098920/f5790c5c37abc142e90bfcbeb2d2e3698213b551.jpg"},{"name":"Gardener Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3098920/d470b1ba5d764b7a37a3db04cfa92e612a8d7970.jpg"},{"name":"Apprentice Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3098920/3c22054a39dcc8f947784786fc26111de8edd34a.jpg"},{"name":"Champion Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3098920/81c20d06d07c0ec03ffb321f8e6c2cce28ed07b5.jpg"},{"name":"Ninja Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3098920/067e9742583c17b42406d8b9b6e4b658d2c843ac.jpg"},{"name":"Engineer Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3098920/3c78f21243865499f27f746b36c9cd4e2c3cd304.jpg"},{"name":"Giant Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3098920/f862ee84b2eb7f155802a98ab0eff79be911e79a.jpg"},{"name":"Wealthy Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3098920/5dbd366be2021ef37b35996835badb5f62423cc2.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3098920?t=1771016281","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771016281","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/fc2577db816c84e07e16cd4ac8ed9ca415247246/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771016281","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/fc2577db816c84e07e16cd4ac8ed9ca415247246/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771016281","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wouldn't everyone want to have a giant laser battle cat to overcome life's challenges with a devastating beam?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://share